    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Site for sale 0.4148 hectares/ 1.02 acres located in this scenic location and yet within easy reach of local amenities, with frontage onto a secondary public road and enjoying views over Levally Lough, situated at Massbrook Lower, Bofeenaun. The property is located approximately 2 km from Bofeenaun Village, 6.7 km from Pontoon, 5.9 km from Lahardane and 20 km from Castlebar.Yhe site is being sold subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      }
